flowchart TD
    A[Read the new table for the first time] --> B[Write what one row means]
    B --> C[Find the key and time/order columns]
    C --> D[Check format consistency]
    D --> E[Run the first quality check]
    E --> F{What does the comparison question require}
    F -- Restructure units or storage order --> G[Sort a copy or group by sample]
    F -- Quality or conditions unverified --> I[Hold comparison and check sources and conditions]
    F -- Current structure and conditions suffice --> H[Compare using the current table]
